Subject: [PATCH] unicode: ASCII islands in mixed Qwen2 pretok (0122)

Identity-safe ASCII gaps (ascii_seg) + letter/punct non-ASCII islands
(unicode_seg). Punctuation keeps optional leading space (` ·`, ` 🚀`).
Opt-out: LLAMA_BPE_NO_ASCII_PRETOK. See docs/faster-bpe-tokenize.md (M15d / 0122).

